diff --git a/.changeset/silver-plums-brake.md b/.changeset/silver-plums-brake.md
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..97a3194ba
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changeset/silver-plums-brake.md
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+---
+"wrangler": minor
+---
+
+Add support for env files to wrangler secret bulk i.e. `.dev.vars`
+
+Run `wrangler secret bulk .dev.vars` to add the env file
+
+```env
+//.dev.vars
+KEY=VALUE
+KEY_2=VALUE
+```
+
+This will upload the secrets KEY and KEY_2 to your worker
